 "description": "Benchmark task (docs/benchmark_rules.md), converted 2026-11-11 from the owner-approved golden replay (2026-11-05). Single-NPN class-A common-emitter 433 MHz PA (paper Fig. 3) on the replay's fixture: 50-ohm ports, 12 V, the replay's nine conditions (gpdk090 high-performance BJT sections t / f / s x -40 / 27 / 100 C; nominal = t, 27 C). Targets = the 18 retained metrics of the replay with exactly the limits of its targets.json (paper value with the owner-approved 15 % directional allowance; K > 1 and |Delta| < 1 unrelaxed), each applied at every condition (worst case), as in the replay ('all saved conditions'). Zin / Zout are excluded by the batch (qualifications.json). No objective (D13). G8 gate on pa1088_sp_v1 (bipolar reading, recipes/pa1088_1111_ext.py) at nominal.",
